{"seq":3,"slug":"clouds-fog","title":"云与雾","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/phenomena/clouds-fog","wordCount":1401,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"云与雾\">云与雾</h1><p>云在天上、雾在身边，看似两回事，本质却是同一件事：光在悬浮水汽里的散射。云决定了天空长什么样、阳光透不透得下来、地面有没有飘移的阴影；雾决定了你能看多远、远处的山是否消融在乳白里。这一篇讲游戏如何表现这两种体积现象，以及它们作为天气的「光学输出」如何喂给<a href=\"../presentation/weather-lighting\">天气光照影响</a>与玩法的视野系统。云量从<a href=\"../foundations/weather-state-machine\">天气状态机</a>的 <code>cloudCover</code> 取值，能见度从 <code>visibility</code> 取值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-散射与能见度\">核心概念：散射与能见度</h2><p>云和雾的物理内核是参与介质（participating media）中的光传输：光线穿过介质时不断被散射和吸收，强度按比尔-朗伯定律衰减。设介质消光系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，光走过距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 后透过率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(d) = e^{-\\sigma_t \\, d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>雾就是把这条公式应用到整个场景：远处物体的颜色按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与雾色混合，距离越远越被雾吞没。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接由状态机的 <code>visibility</code> 反推——能见度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 大致是透过率降到某阈值的距离，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_t \\approx -\\ln(0.05)/V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6331em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>。这条公式把「天气状态说能见度 150 米」精确翻译成了渲染参数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[状态机: cloudCover/visibility] --&gt; B[消光系数 sigma_t]&#10;  B --&gt; C[距离雾: 远景混合]&#10;  B --&gt; D[体积雾: 受光散射]&#10;  A --&gt; E[体积云: 天空覆盖]&#10;  E --&gt; F[天光遮蔽/移动云影]&#10;  C --&gt; G[能见度 -&gt; 玩法视野]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; H[天气光照影响]\">flowchart TD\n  A[状态机: cloudCover/visibility] --&gt; B[消光系数 sigma_t]\n  B --&gt; C[距离雾: 远景混合]\n  B --&gt; D[体积雾: 受光散射]\n  A --&gt; E[体积云: 天空覆盖]\n  E --&gt; F[天光遮蔽/移动云影]\n  C --&gt; G[能见度 -&gt; 玩法视野]\n  D --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; H[天气光照影响]</pre><p>下表区分游戏里几种雲雾表现层次及其代价：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>受光</th>\n<th>典型代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>距离雾</td>\n<td>按深度混合雾色</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高度雾</td>\n<td>按海拔叠加密度</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积雾</td>\n<td>视锥体素 + 光照累积</td>\n<td>是（含光柱）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积云</td>\n<td>光线步进 raymarch</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"雾-从距离雾到体积雾\">雾：从距离雾到体积雾</h2><p>最廉价的雾是<strong>距离雾</strong>：在后处理或材质里按片元深度把场景色 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{scene}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与雾色 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{fog}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 混合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>lerp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\text{lerp}(C_{scene}, C_{fog}, 1-T(d))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lerp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>。再进一步是<strong>高度雾</strong>，让密度随海拔下降，制造贴地的晨雾——河谷里浓、山顶上无，这与<a href=\"../foundations/regional-weather\">区域与局部天气</a>的海拔分布天然契合。</p>\n<p>真正有沉浸感的是<strong>体积雾</strong>：把视锥切成一串体素，逐体素累积介质密度与该处接收到的光照，于是雾不再是均匀的灰，而能透出阳光穿过缝隙的「丁达尔光柱」。这一步把雾从单纯的能见度衰减升级成了照明现象，它的最终合成属于<a href=\"../presentation/weather-lighting\">天气光照影响</a>。体积雾还可被风缓慢平移（采样<a href=\"wind-simulation\">风场模拟</a>），让雾气有流动感而非死寂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"云-体积云与它的副作用\">云：体积云与它的副作用</h2><p>2026 年的主流是<strong>体积云</strong>——用光线步进穿过一片由噪声（Perlin-Worley 等）定义的三维云密度场，逐步累积消光与散射，得到能从内部穿越、随时间演化、形态真实的云。这是天气表现里最重的一项，开销大头在每像素的步进次数。各大引擎都把它做成了天气系统的核心：据 Epic 公开资料与社区报道，下一代 Unreal 把天气系统重做为完全体积化，云、雾、雨雪都以三维体积而非平面贴片呈现，并支持体积云、二维动态云、静态云乃至体积极光的混合（Epic 社区教程；UE 插件生态如 Ultra Dynamic Sky、SkyScape 也围绕这套体积天空构建）。</p>\n<p>云对天气系统真正重要的不是它好不好看，而是它的两个<strong>副作用</strong>：一是<strong>天光遮蔽</strong>——厚云挡住太阳，整个场景的主光被压暗、环境光转为阴沉的散射光，这是阴雨天「天色变暗」的物理根源，由<a href=\"../presentation/weather-lighting\">天气光照影响</a>消费 <code>cloudCover</code> 实现；二是<strong>移动云影</strong>——云在地面投下缓慢飘移的阴影，是开放世界里极有说服力的细节，通常用一张随风滚动的云影遮罩纹理实现，比真实体积云投影便宜得多。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[噪声密度场 Perlin-Worley] --&gt; B[光线步进 raymarch]&#10;  C[太阳方向] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; D[云的颜色与透过率]&#10;  D --&gt; E[天空合成]&#10;  D --&gt; F[天光遮蔽量]&#10;  F --&gt; G[压暗主光/抬环境光]&#10;  H[风场] --&gt; I[云影遮罩滚动]&#10;  I --&gt; J[地面移动云影]\">flowchart TD\n  A[噪声密度场 Perlin-Worley] --&gt; B[光线步进 raymarch]\n  C[太阳方向] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; D[云的颜色与透过率]\n  D --&gt; E[天空合成]\n  D --&gt; F[天光遮蔽量]\n  F --&gt; G[压暗主光/抬环境光]\n  H[风场] --&gt; I[云影遮罩滚动]\n  I --&gt; J[地面移动云影]</pre><h2 id=\"雾-云与玩法-性能的接口\">雾、云与玩法、性能的接口</h2><p>云与雾不只是好看，它们直接改写玩法。能见度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 被玩法层取走当作<strong>视野与索敌距离</strong>的衰减——浓雾里 AI 的感知范围和玩家的可视距离一同缩短，这条接口由<a href=\"../practice/weather-gameplay\">天气玩法影响</a>消费，并与<a href=\"../../game-fog-of-war-visibility/\">战争迷雾与可见性</a>的可见性判定叠加。</p>\n<p>在性能上，体积云与体积雾是天气里最贵的两项，几乎一定要分级：移动端常退化到体积云用低分辨率半体素 + 时间重投影，或干脆退回到天空盒云 + 距离雾；主机/PC 才上满步进。具体的分辨率、步进次数、时间重投影等降级策略详见<a href=\"../practice/weather-performance\">天气性能</a>。把「能见度」这个玩法量和「体积云步进」这个渲染量解耦，正是为了能在保住玩法一致的前提下自由降级画面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>云雾的内核是参与介质的散射与吸收，透过率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(d)=e^{-\\sigma_t d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；能见度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 反推消光系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>雾分距离雾（最廉价）、高度雾（贴地晨雾）、体积雾（受光、有光柱）三档，按预算选。</li>\n<li>2026 主流体积云用噪声密度场 + 光线步进；引擎正全面转向完全体积化的天气表现。</li>\n<li>云对天气真正重要的是两个副作用：天光遮蔽（压暗场景）与移动云影（地面飘影）。</li>\n<li>把玩法量「能见度」与渲染量「体积步进」解耦，才能在保玩法一致的同时自由降级画面。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>云量与能见度的来源：<a href=\"../foundations/weather-state-machine\">天气状态机</a></li>\n<li>高度雾与海拔分布的契合：<a href=\"../foundations/regional-weather\">区域与局部天气</a></li>\n<li>雾云被风平移：<a href=\"wind-simulation\">风场模拟</a></li>\n<li>天光遮蔽如何改写照明：<a href=\"../presentation/weather-lighting\">天气光照影响</a></li>\n<li>体积云的渲染管线归属：<a href=\"../../game-graphics/\">游戏图形</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"云与雾","id":"云与雾"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：散射与能见度","id":"核心概念-散射与能见度"},{"level":2,"text":"雾：从距离雾到体积雾","id":"雾-从距离雾到体积雾"},{"level":2,"text":"云：体积云与它的副作用","id":"云-体积云与它的副作用"},{"level":2,"text":"雾、云与玩法、性能的接口","id":"雾-云与玩法-性能的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"风场模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/phenomena/wind-simulation"},"next":{"title":"天气光照影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/presentation/weather-lighting"}}